  partName: Rear Blade 1
  description: The Rear Blade 1 is a tiny, elongated component situated at the middle-center-rear
    of the engine, crafted from Blades texture material. As part of the engine's
    turbine section, it helps to extract energy from the exhaust gases, converting
    it into mechanical energy. Notably, its unique shape and material properties
    enable it to withstand the high-temperature and high-stress environment of the
    turbine.
